{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前「東張女神」林泳淘（Wingto）自從與初戀男友結婚升呢人妻後，身材保養得宜，時常在社群平台分享生活近況。日前她再次於社交平台「大放送」，貼出清涼泳裝照，惹來大批網民及粉絲暴動按讚！</p><figure><img alt=\"激罕曬泳照！（IG/@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184180623862927360279415.jpeg/3BpYXLkwXOU17OdP_ZH4_Ernbh1nF-m8HvtqAx77agM\"/><figcaption>激罕曬泳照！（IG/@wingt）</figcaption></figure><p>側身斜躺沙灘　骨感美與陽光美貌並重</p><p>照片中，林泳淘身穿設計俐落的白色掛頸背心式三點式泳衣，側身斜躺在清澈見底的淺灘海水中。她仰頭面向陽光燦爛微笑，展現出無瑕的鎖骨線條與迷人身形，全身濕透的自然狀態更顯性感與活力。雖然已為人妻，但林泳淘對身材管理依然相當嚴格，渾身散發自然不造作的氣質。相片一出，即時獲大量粉絲與網民狂讚，大誇她「零人妻味」、「狀態極佳」！</p><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好好！（IG/@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184239367825264640895720.jpeg/q0pz4xv0V1Ez0cmAGGycQUYm4KljqhmcUsDd3lLA3d4\"/><figcaption>Keep得好好！（IG/@wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好好！（IG/@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261006/1184239365350494208987512.jpeg/7WXm4CZcWyZlCH9JE2eozkEa_ZZMUThi4jsyoOI7MqA\"/><figcaption>Keep得好好！（IG/@wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林泳淘順道旅行下水禮。（IG：@Wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231110/799753751647752192461357.jpeg/qkAM6NJqm77LIYY4-Dv2GYTJi0GhsgN7GRDsPBkQ7Dw\"/><figcaption>林泳淘順道旅行下水禮。（IG：@Wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林泳淘與老公鴛鴦戲水。（IG：@Wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231110/799753839908491264182059.jpeg/VYVvZ_q5vW4BX891jkmg68nN5asPOM1c6Ga9_ehmvf0\"/><figcaption>林泳淘與老公鴛鴦戲水。（IG：@Wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2021年與拍拖14年的初戀男友林卓立結婚。（IG@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231220/814217955238744064791826.jpeg/QuZHBLi51sOL6dKz7b_QMvS5n_FnFVy_hO0OzoTtDs4\"/><figcaption>2021年與拍拖14年的初戀男友林卓立結婚。（IG@wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林泳淘之前都有公開過婚紗造型照。（Instagram/@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4495362/org/3adc4fbcc131d02f297a42dd577009e0.jpg/0x7vL0iN4EEq64WWaxAHuYV7vKKbw2gXIGQqZSBkKmU\"/><figcaption>林泳淘之前都有公開過婚紗造型照。（Instagram/@wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"前TVB主播林泳淘轉戰YouTube界後大受歡迎。（IG/ @wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4435289/org/15b9e88a7e6525b3e36999bbae69ce3e.jpg/mfgQLvL47E8pMC9hs0jF0aeNRovNm3UN5YBR9-WAUfc\"/><figcaption>前TVB主播林泳淘轉戰YouTube界後大受歡迎。（IG/ @wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林泳淘間中都會公開水着照。（Instagram/@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4115502/org/b8fe6a9d1ad3c8c0ac9634710c147670.jpg/i7Q9ft8e3Mq9A6z9sIrGcnKHrnmeCVxZcG2Ow3BtjsM\"/><figcaption>林泳淘間中都會公開水着照。（Instagram/@wingt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林泳淘間中都會公開水着照。（Instagram/@wingt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4115503/org/8602885d63bd36a7d692d543d4c337d1.jpg/8AJGbWZf6RME4QJavJZiao2Qk39wLaoh0BkPcNAZD3A\"/><figcaption>林泳淘間中都會公開水着照。（Instagram/@wingt）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T07:19:24.375097+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":544,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}